    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf00a4048a91ac914b0b9560",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怎么可能会有这种事！她是我母亲的学生！\n我的母亲从现役选手退下来后，\n自己经营了学校，负责教赛马娘跑步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "149a24cafd456a554d28fa791dd5030307d90895da3247ecaf527bc25678578c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1068/storytimeline_501068115.json",
      "json_path": [
