    {
      "uid": "zhcn:434de6e6c5065599983fe8dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁莽狂音是当中最受期待的学生。\n所以在学园的时候，\n就由我代替我母亲当她的顾问。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1190581ede4f144ad0458847ff34b321eda1828a7a72e97a2837f46b1262ab2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1068/storytimeline_501068115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bb12d03effaf567485de518",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这位赛马娘是气槽。她是学生会的副会长。\n因为拥有崇高的理想和坚强的实力，\n被誉为“女帝”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3664a74e6a272ac052081b4c5c248c9e4cdfa622164c3b7471e4246f4ab15541",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1068/storytimeline_501068115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ef913830eefbe95107ed1b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽的母亲是足以青史留名的赛马娘，\n刚才的“鲁莽狂音”\n似乎就是受她教导的学生。",
      "source_fingerprint": "777a2a7cfbf49555c36ab863b2615a0a359ba4f20c07e6c6cea6e7267c800374",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1068/storytimeline_501068115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:137fb1abee0c0a04d0442eba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "记者A",
      "source_fingerprint": "e727284e47e7d9a58d24f984ebd7a8d19c16f65187c12dd1c7871d7683e242d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
