      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她顺利在1800米的比赛取得二连胜，\n以这种优异表现，长距离应该也难不倒她，\n所以我决定让她挑战经典三冠路线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7aa943ab860fa327e7747e1abd2b8ea9e7ed4b1404ff262e03a1ea0fa44b89bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
